                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-147_l54" HPOS="457" VPOS="2771" WIDTH="1661" HEIGHT="73" BASELINE="459 2818 2118 2810" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="459 2818 459 2834 801 2844 804 2844 806 2844 834 2834 1089 2842 1092 2842 1094 2842 1131 2831 1219 2842 1222 2842 1341 2829 1614 2840 1616 2840 1618 2840 1646 2829 1700 2840 1702 2840 1705 2840 1746 2827 1808 2838 1811 2838 2014 2827 2114 2838 2118 2810 2114 2784 2060 2771 2058 2771 2055 2771 2008 2782 1919 2771 1917 2771 1752 2782 1722 2771 1720 2771 1718 2771 1715 2771 1679 2784 1620 2773 1618 2773 1616 2773 1577 2786 1403 2786 1386 2773 1384 2773 1382 2773 1380 2773 1222 2786 1161 2775 1159 2775 1157 2775 1128 2786 1063 2775 1061 2775 990 2786 873 2775 871 2775 869 2775 866 2775 849 2788 457 2782 459 2818"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="With a strange driver, the dog-team is wayward and very shy. For"/>
